{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14231460","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14231460","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1423146001:0":{"text":"……って、あれは……フーキンじゃないか！","source_cn":"嚯！是呼金小子！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C3796CF63269F8E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423146002:0":{"text":"ゾーヤ先生！いやぁ、相変わらず昔のまんまだな！","source_cn":"祖娅老师！你还是和以前一样啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C40018CBBC42BB5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423146003:0":{"text":"オマエはだいぶ変わったね！村を出た頃はひよっこだったのに、すっかり立派になって！","source_cn":"呼金，你可是变了好多啊！你离开村子那会儿可还是个毛头小子！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x849612DA8B324AF3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1423146004:0":{"text":"先生が動いてるってことは、村はそれだけ深刻ってことか……","source_cn":"村里的事都大到惊动你出山了吗……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9CAA2250DCFB1194","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423146005:0":{"text":"しばらくは村の責任者として働くよ。少なくとも、この混乱を何とかしなきゃな。","source_cn":"我得暂时当一段时间村里的负责人了，起码得把这个局面收拾...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x02D85E996FC5EE89","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1423146006:0":{"text":"でも、なんでいきなり帰ってきたんだ？オレが恋しくなったのか？","source_cn":"你怎么突然想起回村的？总不会是因为想我这个老人家吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x61F5A3FF7DC9CA03","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1423146007:0":{"text":"まさか！村の異変を聞いて、慌てて戻ってきたんだよ！","source_cn":"我这次也是听说村子出了事，专程回来的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7014BFCFC28CC373","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1423146008:0":{"text":"そうだ！こいつらを紹介するよ、アイアンヘッドにヒートトング、ハードストーン！ほら、先生にご挨拶しろ！","source_cn":"对了，祖娅老师！这是铁头，这是尖哨，这是矮地……来，跟...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1AAD0A314C62C4B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:10:1423146009:0":{"text":"フーキンとゾーヤは、積もる話に花を咲かせた――\n今は、二人の時間を邪魔しないでおこう。","source_cn":"呼金和祖娅滔滔不绝地叙起了旧……\\n让他们师徒单独相处...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x227EF3361630723D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:祖娅":{"text":"ゾーヤ","source":"祖娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:呼金":{"text":"フーキン","source":"呼金","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"黒画面字幕","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":10,"localized_text_count":9,"speaker_count":3}}